  "description": "<p><strong>Default Peely from: Fortnite Battle Royale</strong></p>\n<p>**Drag &amp; Drop in your SPT directory [User&gt;Mods]</p>\n<p>Credits: Fortnite, Epic Games + <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/user-file-list/65738-wuvgawore/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WUVGAWORE</a>**</p>\n<p>After installation it’ll be in Ragman Clothing Services</p>\n<p><strong>Recommended but not required:</strong> Use the <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/654-hide-dress/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Hide Dress</a> mod to prevent any gear from clipping through</p>\n<p>All credit for the porting goes to <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/user-file-list/65738-wuvgawore/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WUVGAWORE</a>.</p>\n<p>Please note, there will be no further updates.</p>\n",
